please  help my online store so i got a great  question for one of my youtube viewers  love you guys rihanna who wrote in to  say what if i have an  online store and not an actual store  then what do you do  this is a great question rihanna thank  you so much for writing in i have three  suggestions  to help you market your online store  number one is lead with your values  this is so important i need to know what  it is that you stand for because  the challenge with a lot of online  stores is you're selling the same stuff  right you're selling the exact same  product that i can get at a thousand  other websites so why am i gonna buy  from you  instead of somebody else you have two  options you either  compete on price which is a race to the  bottom which is  you know you're making pennies in  profits  or you compete on values and values is  i'm buying into an experience  i'm buying into a company that's trying  to make the world a better place  and you need to show me how you're doing  that so an example that i want you to  look at  is honest.com and i've talked about them  a few times on this channel  they are an online retailer they have  over 100 million dollars in sales  and they believe in honest  they have products that are honestly  made that don't have chemicals in them  that are all natural that are organic  that the suppliers treat their people  in a humane way right they  care about honesty  and so some people will go to that  website and and say honest is a stupid i  don't care about that you know  i just want the cheapest product and  that's fine you're going to lose out on  those customers but there are other  customers who are going to come  and they'll see that and they'll love it  and say yes finally it's exactly what i  was looking for and those people are  willing to pay a premium  for what you're selling if you go to my  website you'll see it's all about belief  right  believe that oozes out of everything i  do it's right at the top  of every page of my website you can't  help but get hit  with a punch in the face of belief  and some people they love that right  some people hate that  you know for the people who hate that  though the people who hate that  they're not probably gonna be great  customers for me anyway right if you  don't  believe and believe you're probably not  watching this video you shut it down  within the first five seconds you bounce  to my website i'm not going to sell to  you anyway  so it's about leading with your values  because people who  believe in what you're doing will pay  more for it  making it super obvious and it's  attracting  a target audience who are going to be  ideal customers  who will love what you do and can't wait  to tell their friends about it  number two is have a newsletter date  before getting  married this is really important because  a lot of online stores  they just try to sell right and when  somebody is is making a decision to buy  something they'll often browse they'll  browse between  different websites trying to educate  themselves and figure out what they're  going to do  and they may never come back to your  website they may visit it once and never  come back and  you know leading with the values makes  it memorable but you also want a way to  build a relationship instead of just  asking for the sale  asking for the sale right away is like  going up to somebody on the street and  saying hey will you marry me  like the chance of it happening it  happens but the conversion rate is  really really low  what you want to do is date before  getting married get to know them  send some value let them get to know you  let them  see that you know you believe in what  you're doing and so the great way to do  that is through your newsletter so you  want to get people  who come to your website to sign up for  your newsletter so you can send them  information  and maintain a relationship and so when  they're ready to make that buying  decision they're more likely to go with  you  so get a solid newsletter in place date  before getting married and number three  is send value in  every email this is a huge mistake a lot  of entrepreneurs make is  when they send out an email it's it's  all promotional it's all  product focused there's very little  value what i want you to do  is make my life better don't send me  coupon codes and discounts and sales  offers all the time  send me value right again this ties back  to that top feeling we're trying to  create  tell me how i can live an honest life  tell me how i can believe in myself  make me feel something towards your  company if i  love your business and what it stands  for and you're making me a better  person through the content that you're  sharing in your newsletter  guess what i'm much more likely to buy  your products  and to talk about you and to make a  video about you  right so few companies do this because  they're so  transaction focused and it's a race to  the bottom  so make sure with every newsletter that  you're sending out what i want you to do  i want you to think of this as your  asset test is do i feel proud of what  i've just written  am i proud of this newsletter  and if you're not then don't waste  people's  inbox time you want to feel like you're  giving  solid value and the five minutes that  somebody takes out of their day is  precious  and you're going to be making their life  better so you need to be proud of  every single marketing communication  that goes out there and if you're not  redo it so in summary number one  lead with your values number two have a  newsletter and date before getting  married  and number three send value in every  email  believe thank you so much rihanna for  the great question for those of you  watching you like the video you can  subscribe to the channel  to see more videos just like this thank  you so much i'll see you soon

